# Feature flags baked into production-mode builds (`vite build`, i.e. what Vercel
# runs to deploy). Only overrides listed here are set; every other VITE_* var
# (API base URL, etc.) still comes from the Vercel project's environment.
#
# Enable the Configurable Rent Type v2 UI — the "Is the rent staggered?" flow +
# the Dine-in / Delivery revenue-share split — across New Pipeline, Add Details,
# and the post-NSO launch review. Merging this to main bakes the flag ON for the
# dev-server deploy. Set to false (or delete this file) to revert to the current
# four-card selector. Build-time only: a redeploy is required for a change here.
VITE_FEATURE_RENT_V2=true
